          "start": 1527,
          "end": 1566,
          "quote": "This allows the blood vessels to relax."
        }
      ],
      "policy_rules": [],
      "note": "钙通道阻滞剂段支持血管放松，原绑定仅含β阻滞剂/利尿剂/联合用药，属于引用缺口。",
      "professional_review": "pending",
      "anchor_status": "passed",
      "citation_status": "citation_gap"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "basic-03",
